# ---------- The Swarm (silithid hive) ----------
T 1146 | Moktar Krin, north-west across the flats at their western edge, where the canyon road from Freewind Post comes down
A 1147
A 1148 @ Thousand Needles, 67.7, 82.5 | Silithid hive south of Moktar Krin. Kill silithids until a Cracked Silithid Carapace drops and right-click it at once, so the parts start dropping.
C 1147,1148 @ Thousand Needles, 68.5, 85.5 | Same hive: 5 Searchers, 5 Hive Drones, 5 Invaders, plus 1 Heart, 5 Talons and 3 Intact Carapaces from any of them. Searchers (32-33) are on the north and east edge, Drones (33-34) fill the middle, Invaders (34-35) hold the west edge (64,86). They stand in groups: pull from the edge, drop Stoneclaw Totem when two come, Earthbind any that run. The Silithid Ravager (37, rare) walks the north side: fight it only when it is alone.
L 37 @ Thousand Needles, 68.5, 85.5 | Not 37 yet? Keep killing silithids here; the Invaders (34-35) on the west edge give the most XP. The five turn-ins still ahead add about 11k XP, so you can stop that far short of 37.
T 1147 | Back north to Moktar Krin

# ---------- Thunder Bluff, Crossroads, Orgrimmar ----------
G Thousand Needles, 45.1, 49.1 | Ghost Wolf west up the canyon road to Freewind Post (wind rider master Nyse)
FLY Thunder Bluff
T 1276 | Mosarn
TRAIN @ Thunder Bluff, 22.8, 21.1 | Shaman trainers in the Pools of Vision under Spirit Rise, beside Apothecary Zamah: learn your level 36 spells (and any level 34 ones you skipped at the start of this segment)
FLY Crossroads
T 1148 @ The Barrens, 51.1, 29.6 | Korran
A 1184 @ The Barrens, 51.1, 29.6 | Korran. For Belgrom in Orgrimmar.
FLY Orgrimmar
T 1184 | Belgrom Rockmaul, Valley of Honor (east side of the city)
T 1436 | Keldran, on the west side of the city
N Start saving gold for your mount | At 40 (first step of segment 16) you learn Wolf Riding from Kildar and buy a wolf from Ogunaro in the Valley of Honor: roughly 90-100 gold at Classic prices. Keep about that much from here on; sell greys and skip pricey upgrades.
N Take the zeppelin to the Undercity @ Durotar, 50.8, 13.5 | Leave by the main gate; the zeppelin tower is just outside. Board the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades (Undercity), not the one to Grom'gol. Your hearthstone stays on Shadowprey Village.
